into dropboxes.

00:05:17.701 --> 00:05:19.968
Arizona's secretary
of state's office

00:05:19.968 --> 00:05:23.434
has referred six incidents
of potential voter intimidation

00:05:23.434 --> 00:05:26.767
in these parking lots
to the FBI for investigation.

00:05:26.767 --> 00:05:29.400
Some individuals have been
armed and masked.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.400
