these people

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.501
did varying numbers
at two different dropboxes

00:05:34.501 --> 00:05:37.901
in Maricopa County,
people sitting in lawn chairs

00:05:37.901 --> 00:05:40.734
and then, some say,
they are camo-clad,

00:05:40.734 --> 00:05:43.000
that they are intimidating,

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.234
that they have a clear intent
to intimidate.

00:05:46.234 --> 00:05:47.400
-Alright, first of all,
why the [bleep]

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.067
