They rolled me back
into the car corral, sir.

00:06:09.834 --> 00:06:12.400
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.567 --> 00:06:17.267
It continues to shock me,
how these guys continue to be

00:06:17.267 --> 00:06:18.934
