00:06:20.801 --> 00:06:23.968
We are living in an era
of lethal dip[bleep].

00:06:23.968 --> 00:06:25.901
[ Laughter ]
On the one hand, they're
accomplishing their mission

00:06:25.901 --> 00:06:27.667
