00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.701
which infuriated Trump.

00:09:49.701 --> 00:09:51.400
In fact, a film crew
following Masters

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.767
for a Tucker Carlson documentary
captured a phone call from Trump

00:09:54.767 --> 00:09:58.000
in which Trump told Masters
to stand firm on the claim

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.701
that the 2020 election
was stolen.

00:09:59.701 --> 00:10:02.067
-Mr. President,
how are you, sir?

00:10:02.067 --> 00:10:03.033
Doing great.

00:10:03.033 --> 00:10:05.968
[ Tender tune plays ]

00:10:19.167 --> 00:10:20.901
Absolutely,
we stay with those people.

00:10:35.734 --> 00:10:36.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:39.033 --> 00:10:40.901
I'm not going soft.

00:10:40.901 --> 00:10:42.801
[ Laughter ]
-I didn't think anything
could be more grating

00:10:42.801 --> 00:10:43.934
than Trump talking,

00:10:43.934 --> 00:10:46.200
but I underestimated
Speakerphone Trump.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.534
[ Laughter ]

00:10:47.534 --> 00:10:48.567
It really accentuates

00:10:48.567 --> 00:10:50.634
just how much his throat
has deteriorated.

00:10:50.634 --> 00:10:52.033
He sounds like he's been smoking

00:10:52.033 --> 00:10:53.767
three packs of Marlboros
every day

00:10:53.767 --> 00:10:54.901
and eating one.

00:10:54.901 --> 00:10:57.367
[ Laughter ]
And, sure enough, the entire GOP

00:10:57.367 --> 00:10:59.400
and their media apparatus are
in lockstep behind Trump.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:01.667
In fact, they're now
even claiming, preemptively,

00:11:01.667 --> 00:11:02.968
that any Democratic wins

00:11:02.968 --> 00:11:05.100
in the midterms next week
must be illegitimate,

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:06.834
like, say,
if John Fetterman wins

00:11:06.834 --> 00:11:08.434
the Senate race in Pennsylvania,
even though polls

00:11:08.434 --> 00:11:11.367
have consistently shown him
leading Dr. Oz.

00:11:11.367 --> 00:11:12.734
-It's not about the person.

00:11:12.734 --> 00:11:14.000
It's about the party.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.300
It's not about the individual.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:16.334
It's about the group.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.834
And, to prove it,
they can even run

00:11:18.834 --> 00:11:21.234
mentally defective candidates
who can barely speak

00:11:21.234 --> 00:11:23.701
and not only expect them
to [ Raising voice ] "win,"

00:11:23.701 --> 00:11:25.734
but expect you to accept
the outcome,

00:11:25.734 --> 00:11:28.000
no matter how transparently
absurd it is.

00:11:29.367 --> 00:11:30.701
On November 9th,
they'll be telling you

00:11:30.701 --> 00:11:33.367
that John Fetterman got
81 million votes in Pennsylvania

00:11:33.367 --> 00:11:34.567
and they'll threaten
to put you in jail,

00:11:34.567 --> 00:11:35.667
if you don't believe it.

00:11:35.667 --> 00:11:36.834
Why wouldn't they do that?

00:11:36.834 --> 00:11:38.100
It worked with Joe Biden.

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:38.968
-[ As Carlson ]
Why wouldn't they do that?

00:11:38.968 --> 00:11:40.033
Why wouldn't they conspire

00:11:40.033 --> 00:11:41.767
to steal an election
in Pennsylvania

00:11:41.767 --> 00:11:43.100
and throw you in jail,
if you don't believe it?

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.834
Why wouldn't they come
to your house

00:11:44.834 --> 00:11:46.667
and ask who you voted for
and, if you say Republican,

00:11:46.667 --> 00:11:48.000
why wouldn't they take
your house away?

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:50.000
Why wouldn't they take your car
and all your money?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.267
Why wouldn't they
take your dog?

00:11:51.267 --> 00:11:53.067
Why wouldn't they take
your second, secret dog

00:11:53.067 --> 00:11:55.767
[ Laughter ]
that's an exact replica
of your first dog,

00:11:55.767 --> 00:11:57.901
that you keep in your basement
because you've been anticipating

00:11:57.901 --> 00:11:59.834
that the leftist woke regime
would come to your house

00:11:59.834 --> 00:12:01.200
and take your first dog?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.400
[ Laughter ]

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.901
Why wouldn't they threaten
to put you in jail

00:12:03.901 --> 00:12:05.100
or kick you off social media

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.601
or ban you
from your favorite restaurant,

00:12:06.601 --> 00:12:08.000
Carrabba's Italian Grill,

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.534
[ Laughter ]
and, when you show up
to Carrabba's

00:12:09.534 --> 00:12:10.701
in a fake mustache,

00:12:10.701 --> 00:12:12.501
why wouldn't they point
and laugh and say,

00:12:12.501 --> 00:12:13.834
"Did you really think
that would work?"

00:12:13.834 --> 00:12:16.601
And then why wouldn't they drag
you into the parking lot

00:12:16.601 --> 00:12:18.734
and make you sit next
to small bushes

00:12:18.734 --> 00:12:20.501
you only later realize
were actually

00:12:20.501 --> 00:12:22.534
camouflaged dip[bleep]
lawn chairs?

00:12:22.534 --> 00:12:25.200
[ Laughter and applause ]
This is all, obviously, insane

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.400
and, to combat it,
the Democratic Party has turned

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:28.634
to, perhaps,
its most popular figure

00:12:28.634 --> 00:12:30.033
for the last days
of the campaign --

00:12:30.033 --> 00:12:32.367
Barack Obama, who's been out,
hitting the campaign trail

00:12:32.367 --> 00:12:34.334
to push back on Republican
conspiracy theories,

00:12:34.334 --> 00:12:35.534
like, at recent rallies

00:12:35.534 --> 00:12:37.834
for Wisconsin Senate candidate
Mandela Barnes

00:12:37.834 --> 00:12:39.534
and Michigan Governor
Gretchen Whitmer.

00:12:39.534 --> 00:12:41.367
-Mandela's opponent
has done more

00:12:41.367 --> 00:12:44.200
than just
about anybody in Congress

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:48.000
to spread conspiracy theories
about the 2020 election.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.033
I mean, he has a gold medal

00:12:50.033 --> 00:12:52.567
[ Laughter ]
in that event.

00:12:52.567 --> 00:12:59.667
If that doesn't
elicit uniform outrage,

00:12:59.667 --> 00:13:02.033
what will?

00:13:02.033 --> 00:13:03.667
What does it take?

00:13:03.667 --> 00:13:06.968
The other day, a video came out
of Governor Whitmer's opponent,

00:13:06.968 --> 00:13:09.901
claiming that Democrats
have been working, for decades,

00:13:09.901 --> 00:13:12.701
to topple the United States

00:13:12.701 --> 00:13:15.634
because they're still upset
about losing the Civil War.

00:13:15.634 --> 00:13:17.167
[ Laughter ]

00:13:17.167 --> 00:13:19.767
And that COVID restrictions

00:13:19.767 --> 00:13:22.100
were part of some master plan
to do this.

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:24.934
Now, first of all,

00:13:24.934 --> 00:13:25.934
what?!

00:13:25.934 --> 00:13:29.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:29.734 --> 00:13:30.534
What -- What?!

00:13:32.501 --> 00:13:33.267
[ Scoffs ]

00:13:34.434 --> 00:13:35.434
What?!

00:13:35.434 --> 00:13:37.000
[ Laughter ]

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.400
-Whatever else you may
think of him,

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.534
you can't help but love
stand-up comedy Obama.

00:13:40.534 --> 00:13:41.667
[ Laughter and applause ]
I mean,

00:13:41.667 --> 00:13:44.334
clearly working on material

00:13:44.334 --> 00:13:46.000
for his new Netflix special...

00:13:47.501 --> 00:13:48.968
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:13:48.968 --> 00:13:50.467
It's just nice to see
a politician have

00:13:50.467 --> 00:13:53.067
a normal human reaction to how
utterly deranged this all is.

00:13:53.067 --> 00:13:55.634
I wish we could use that
as a reaction clip

00:13:55.634 --> 00:13:57.033
for everything going forward.

00:13:57.033 --> 00:13:58.467
-On November 9th,
they'll be telling you

00:13:58.467 --> 00:14:01.200
that John Fetterman got
81 million votes in Pennsylvania

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.434
and they'll threaten
to put you in jail,

00:14:02.434 --> 00:14:03.667
if you don't believe it.

00:14:03.667 --> 00:14:04.467
-What?!

00:14:04.467 --> 00:14:06.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:06.033 --> 00:14:08.367
The stakes of this midterm
election couldn't be higher.

00:14:08.367 --> 00:14:09.601
Republicans have made
that clear.

00:14:09.601 --> 00:14:11.033
They've told us
what they plan to do

00:14:11.033 --> 00:14:12.801
if they win back power,
both in Congress

00:14:12.801 --> 00:14:14.267
and in key states
across the country,

00:14:14.267 --> 00:14:17.167
and priority number one seems
to be rigging future elections

00:14:17.167 --> 00:14:19.367
and laying the groundwork
for the next coup attempt.

00:14:19.367 --> 00:14:21.400
They're already preemptively
claiming these elections

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.634
will be illegitimate,
if they lose.

00:14:22.634 --> 00:14:25.300
Most people react
to those voter fraud claims

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.601
the same way I reacted

00:14:26.601 --> 00:14:29.467
when I first saw Wally's tiny,
wet sponge, by saying...

00:14:29.467 --> 00:14:30.334
-What?!

00:14:30.334 --> 00:14:31.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:31.634 --> 00:14:33.267
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:14:33.267 --> 00:14:36.934
♪♪

00:14:36.934 --> 00:14:38.734
The midterm elections
are coming up, so,

00:14:38.734 --> 00:14:41.334
to make sure that you're good
to vote in this election,

00:14:41.334 --> 00:14:44.400
visit our good friends
at headcount.org

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:48.467
to check your voter registration
status or to register to vote.

